.git
# Beyond context size: the ui stage runs `npm ci` and THEN `COPY ui/frontend/ ./`, so an
# un-ignored node_modules would overwrite the clean install.
**/node_modules
ui/frontend/dist
docs/dist
# `COPY . .` would put a live token in a build layer — cached and exportable, though not shipped.
**/.env
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
/genroc
/genctl
